  </div>
    <div class="card-content">
    

  
      
  <h3 class="field field--name-field-link field--type-link field--label-hidden field__items"><a href="/departments/office-homeless-services/news/2026-pit-count" hreflang="en">2026 Point in Time Count</a>
  </h3>
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-description field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item">A one-night count of sheltered and unsheltered persons experiencing homelessness in Nashville.</div>
  </div>

          </div>
  </div>
</div>
  </div>
      </div>
            </div>
</div>
        <div class="field__item">
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          <div class="cog--mq">
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item"><h2><span>American Rescue Plan Act (ARPA)</span></h2><p><span>American Rescue Plan Act (ARPA) Funding helped thousands. These are their stories.</span></p></div>
  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
        <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--video paragraph--view-mode--default">
                
  <div class="field field--name-field-video field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item"><article>
  
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-oembed-video field--type-string field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item"><iframe src="https://www.nashville.gov/media/oembed?url=https%3A//www.youtube.com/watch%3Fv%3Dur4-9EeveTo&amp;max_width=0&amp;max_height=0&amp;hash=l3occkYKamrQR-ilhqYFGvmXxBMsi1nKHFlYqOSoflI" width="200" height="113" class="media-oembed-content" loading="eager" title="06/25/26 American Rescue Plan Act Impact Video"></iframe>
</div>
  </div>
  </article>
</div>
  </div>
      </div>
</div>
        <div class="field__item">
  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          <div class="cog--mq">
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item"><h2>2026 State of Homelessness Symposium</h2><p><span>The 2026 State of Homelessness Symposium was held on June 23, 2026, at the Fairgrounds Nashville. The symposium was Nashville's annual opportunity to examine homelessness trends, share progress, and discuss strategies for addressing housing instability across the community.</span></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/live/eZhsEtCXZw0" data-entity-type="external">Watch the 2026 State of Homelessness Symposium here</a>.<br> </p><h2>Faces of Strobel House</h2><p>Strobel House, Metro’s First Permanent Supportive Housing, celebrated 1-Year of service. Hear their stories of recovery, life and second chances because of Strobel House.</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xh3P4yBZjr4&amp;feature=youtu.be">The Faces of Strobel House</a></p></div>
  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
        <div class="field__item">

  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--cards paragraph--view-mode--default">
              <div class="cog--mq">
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__items">
